- gather: collect up to 2 units of resource.
- donate B<k>: give up to 2 units to bystander k.
- plunder P<k>: take up to 2 units from player k if possible.
- defend: prevent player k from plundering (paying 1 unit to do so).

Players can choose to not move (wait) if they do not want to risk losing resources.

End of game: the player with the most resources wins. In case of a tie, the player who completed more rounds wins.
