- bribe B<k>: offer up to 4 gold coins to bystander k to avoid theft detection.
- guard B<k>: spend 3 gold coins to protect bystander k from theft.
- report P<k>: accuse partner k of theft, causing all partners to lose 2 gold coins if P<k> was stealing.

Bystander B0 initially has 10 gold coins. Bystander B1 starts with no gold coins.
