- irrigate <well>: spend 1 resource to increase water supply by 1, but decrease food supply by 1;
- trade <player> <amount>: exchange <amount> resources with another player;
- rob <bystander> <amount>: steal up to <amount> resources from a neutral bystander (they lose up to half);
