- steal D from B1: if there is more than 1 Deer at B1, steal half (rounded down) of its Deers.
- guard B0: spend 1 food to prevent other hunters from stealing from B0.
- guard B1: spend 1 food to prevent other hunters from stealing from B1.
The game ends when all rounds are completed. Hunters can earn food by hunting prey or stealing from bystanders, 
