- sponsor: pay 2 to gain 1 from the society's treasury.
- steal: take up to 5 from P<k>, a fellow scholar who does not play. If stolen, P<k> cannot meditate next turn.
- donate: give up to 3 to another P<l>. If done, P<l> gains 1.
An unskilled scholar at 0 with no sessions is banished: they can only wait or teach P<k> (the society gains 1 from P<k>).
