- explore: earn 1 gold.
- pillage B<k>: take up to 2 gold from bystander k.
- block P<k>: prevent P<k> from exploring on the opposite round.
A bystander's mountain resource diminishes by 1 each turn until it reaches zero, at which point it falls apart into smaller pieces, becoming inaccessible to further exploration.
Each explorer with no gold can block any opponent, but once the mountain falls apart, a player cannot block a player who explored immediately prior.
"""

