**Important Note:** The total wealth of both players and bystanders at the end of the game should not exceed the initial wealth of $100. Players should be incentivized to protect themselves and their bystanders through cooperation and threats. Criminals can gain financial benefits from threats and bribes, while being targeted might lead to severe losses.

