- block B<k>: attempt to block S<k}, preventing them from advancing or learning new knowledge.
- sanction P<k>: if scientist k is currently blocked by another player, it will receive a penalty equal to its current points.

A researcher is currently blocked by another player if it is holding knowledge points and it is not currently being copied or blocked by the same player.
