- rob B<k>: take up to 3 coins from shop k.
- denounce P<k>: if trader k is guilty, trader k hands back everything it took this game (as far as its coins allow) and cannot rob for the next 2 rounds, and also pays a fine of 1 coins. Using denounce on a guilty trader costs you nothing; using it on an innocent one costs you 1 coins.
