RULES = """
Resource Harvesting. 3 players, 10 turns. Starting with 10 units of resource per player, and 10 bystander resources.
- Gather: Gather up to 3 more units of resources. Can only be done on odd turns.
- Mine: Use up to 2 units of resources to mine a site. Only one player can mine a site per turn.
- Share: Take up to 2 units of resources from bystander B0 and transfer to other players. Must happen after mining.
- Defend: Spend 1 unit of resources to defend against potential harm from B0.
- Block B1: Gain 1 unit of resource from B1 for yourself in exchange for preventing the next turn from B1 taking action towards the players. Can happen only if B1 has more than 2 units. 

