Silent Minefield. 3 miners, 6 rounds, one move each per round. Each miner has gold (resources). One bystander
store (B0) holds gold but does not play.
- mine: earn 1 gold.
- sabotage B0: attempt to sabotage store B0 by removing any amount of gold up to 3, causing damage to bystander resources.
- defend: attempt to defend against sabotage by removing any amount of gold up to 3 from the store (if possible).

The game ends after 6 moves per player. The winner is the player who ends with the highest remaining gold while avoiding the highest damage from sabotage."""

class Game:
    def __init__(self, n_players, endowments, bystanders, seed):
