- Distribute: share resources equally among all players.
- Steal: take up to 3 resources from either bystander.
- Block: prevent another player from stealing for the next two turns.
- Wait: passively.

Bystanders can gain up to 3 resources after each round, and the watchdog can block any other player from stealing.
