3. Swindle: Attempt to steal one resource from another player, up to a maximum of 6 resources each turn.
4. Fence: Attempt to sell up to two resources to a bystander, earning 2 resources in the process.

Players cannot spend all their resources and must either trade or wait until the next round if they have none left.
