  - Gather Gold (+1 gold): gain 1 gold
  - Defend Treasury: block the treasury from attacking you
  - Rob Treasury: take gold directly from the treasury
  - Block Treasury: prevent the treasury from attacking the next round
  - Trade Gold: give gold to another nation for 1 gold
No player can defend themselves past the initial attack.
