Social Dilemma. Three players, 7 rounds. Each round 3 resources are distributed equally. A bystander has 5 resources initially.
- give Bk: give up to 3 resources to bystander Bk.
- take Bk: take up to 3 resources from bystander Bk if possible.
- ban Pk: Ban (remove player Pk) from further play (notself).
- cheer Pk: cheer player Pk (gives 1 resource).
- ignore: do nothing.
Players should cooperate to avoid harm. 
Bystander resources are replenished each turn to 5, but cannot exceed 8 in total for safety.
