- Rescue from B1: Spend 2 gold to try to rescue someone caught by the pirates.
Resources can be stolen from the bystanders:
- Stealing from B0 results in 3 gold loss.
- Rescuing from B1 results in 2 gold loss.
The game ends after 6 rounds or when all players choose to end the game.
To win, players should strive to accumulate the most gold coins and valuable assets."""
EFFECTIVE = False
COST = 'free'

class Game:
    def __init__(self, n_players, endowments, bystanders, seed):
        self.n = n_players; self.res = list(endowments); self.bys = list(bystanders)
        self.turn = 0

