(C0) holds treasure but does not play.
- explore: gain 1 treasure.
- pillage C: steal 1 treasure at risk of being caught (guilty). If caught, all treasure must be given to the castle and the player cannot explore for the rest of this round.
- guard C: prevent anyone from stealing from the castle during this round.
A player is guilty if it has stolen from the castle this game.
Only a player with at least 1 treasure can guard."""

