Guard: Prevents P1 from any interactions with the bystander or other players.

End Condition: The game ends after 8 rounds. The final score is based on the resources each player has, where P players' final scores are calculated as: 
Final Score = sum of their resources - min(resource of B0) - (number of times P0 was sanctioned or guarded) 
"""

