   frog caught by a predator.
4. Sanitize P0: P2 can eliminate player P0 for 2 resources. This move must be made directly and only against P0.
5. Sanitize P1/P2: B0 can eliminate either player P1 or P2 for 2 resources, with equal likelihood. This move must 
   be made directly and only against either player P1 or P2.
6. Eliminate P1 (P0): Player P0 can eliminate player P1 for 1 resource if P1 has already used the "Watch" ability 
