7. Eliminate P2 (P0): Player P0 can eliminate player P2 for 1 resource if P2 has already used the "Watch" ability 
   without eliminating P0.
8. Eliminate B0 (P0): Player P0 can eliminate the bystander B0 for 5 resources if B0 has watched the elimination 
  过程 but has not taken any action against P1, P2, or B0.
9. Block (P2): Player P2 can eliminate player P0 for 1 resource. This move must be made directly and only against P0.
10. Defend (P0/P2) (B0): Player P0 or P2 can defend against the bystander B0's attempt to steal from them. If B0 steals from 
    player P0 or P2, they will lose resources. However, defending will also reduce their own resources by 1 resource.
11. Steal (B0): Bystander B0 can attempt to steal from player P0 or P2, taking up to 5 resources from each if successful.
